Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 05:15:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?perf(render):=20quantize=20presentation-query?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20retain=20key=20(~3.0=C3=97)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Quiet chase drift made #74's bit-identical zero-dirty retain miss every
frame. Quantize the retain KEY (bounds/origin) to the same 0.25 WU cell
as authored-instance camera cull; exact floats still drive the full
collect/exactVisible walk when the cell changes. Soft-GPU fps not claimed.
